WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.800
This is the Bellamy family, as we gathered it in May of 2022.

2
00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:09.500
It begins with Reverend Samuel Bellamy, with Lizzie, and with Hattie.

3
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:16.900
And it keeps on growing: seven generations, from our Waycross, Georgia, family to wherever you are reading this.

4
00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.000
Some names are still unknown.

5
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.000
Some children were adopted in.

6
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.100
Some family we choose.

7
00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:25.100
All of them belong here.

8
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:26.400
Take your time.

9
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:30.160
Tap a name, follow a branch, and find yourself in it.
